{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>האשימם</b> — The alef is a root letter, or it interchanges with yod, as in <i>תישמנה</i> (Deuteronomy 31:21), like <i>והאדמה לא תשם</i> (Exodus 23:11)." "And the sense of <b>ממועצותיהם</b> — for their counsel brings them down."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:26.723860526Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}